  "originalAdditions": [
    "Production 49-bone retargeting with articulated finger anchors",
    "Original dominant-bone/region/UV-seam vertex clustering and extrema protection",
    "Original bone-aware neck cut, upper-clavicle compression, flexible neck seal and crew collar",
    "Original source-height plane-split clothing regions and visual sole/heel/toe fit",
    "Local GLB writer, new production bind skeleton/inverse binds and preserved material metadata"
  ],
  "reproduce": "node scripts/assets/build-football-bodies.mjs; --check compares all generated bytes",
  "exportSteps": [
    "Verify packed pinned source SHA-256 and retain its separately documented core CC0 license.",
    "GLTFLoader parse; production retargetHuman and extractFootballBody; compact only referenced body vertices.",
    "Bone-aware neck clipping, original flex neck/crew collar, clean original-source-Y material boundary subdivision, upper-clavicle compression and visual sole fit; mid/low cluster offline by dominant bone, region, UV wrap side and blend-weight band.",
    "Protect six per-dominant-bone extrema and use finer hand/finger/foot cells; aggregate four normalized skin weights.",
    "Fit visual shoe to ankle .08m, sole .01m, heel -.07m and toe +.20m; raise forward sole beyond fixed BALL z=.15 by tan(.85) for push-off, without moving contact rig bones.",
    "Write production 49-bone local rest hierarchy and inverse binds with _REGION/_THETA/TEXCOORD_0 metadata.",
    "Validate source identity, geometry, bounds, skin invariance and posed deformation independently."
  ],
